1
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,200
RAVI: Okay... either I'm a billionaire...

2
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,000
RAVI: ...or I've finally broken the banking system.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
RAVI: MAX! MAX! I'M RICH! I'M ACTUALLY RICH!

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
MAX: You said that about the crypto coin.

5
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,000
RAVI: This is different. Look at it. LOOK AT IT.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,500
MAX: Ravi. Listen to me very carefully. Do NOT spend it.

7
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,800
RAVI: Obviously.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
MAX: RAVI.

9
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,000
RAVI: I'm just looking!

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
RAVI: One of everything.

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
RAVI: And the golden toilet. Obviously the golden toilet.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,500
REPORTER: Ravi! Ravi! What are you going to do with a billion dollars?

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
RAVI: Change the world.

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
MAX: The world is saved.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,500
MAX: Ravi. Where did the money actually come from?

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
RAVI: ...I never asked.

17
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,000
MAX: It's a banking error. They reverse it in twenty-four hours.

18
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,500
RAVI: Can I return it?

19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,000
OWNER: No.

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,500
RAVI: Nine hundred million to go.

21
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:11,000
MAX: So... what did you learn?

22
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:15,000
RAVI: Never trust free money.

23
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
RAVI: WAIT. WHAT?!

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Ravi's bank account survived for 24 hours.

25
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,500
His dignity did not.
